# Contents/Config-0-ResolvedFeatures, section 15.5.8: one boss extrusion, blind, from
# the Front Plane towards +Z, the features item $f. The first extrusion of a part is a
# moExtrusion_c; every later one is a moICE_c with merge off, whose face references
# are the 3Int classes. The two forms differ up to the extrusion's box record.
@section 15.5.8
@if $f.first
class moExtrusion_c 1 as $f.name
